    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "The story centers on the collision between the civilization of immortal cultivation and modern superpower society, constructing a fantasy worldview that spans across different worlds. Yan Sen, an Immortal Emperor from the cultivation realm, travels to modern Earth after the destruction of his sect. Within a superpower academy, he rebuilds his sect and trains students to oppose various superpower factions, all while uncovering the hidden link between Earth's unique magnetic field and supernatural abilities. As forces such as ultra-ancient mechas and a vampire universe intervene, Yan Sen relies on his overwhelming strength to resolve multiple crises and explore the truth behind the Heavenly Realm.",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Immortal Cultivator vs Superheroes",
        "Cultivator vs Superheroes"
    ],
